      "mergeID": "62fb8a9439620432e6b2b6a8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "With the new resolution customization and rotate auto-detect on the camera in open beta, the pictures I'm taking are not showing in order like I'm expecting for my personal image automation scripts that are expecting unicode sort order.\nPlease make it so that the date part of the filename format comes before the resolution part.\nOr if you want to go an extra step, allow us to somehow be able to customize the filename format to our liking.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Improvement to the VRChat pictures' filename format",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62fa43c04a57f07cbbaf060a",
      "private": false,
